5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we're deciding the room's purpose, we should base this on actual data rather than impressions. I want to see how the space is currently being utilized and who is actually using it.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Ryuji. It would be helpful to understand the current patterns of use. I also think we should consider the atmosphere of the room and how it affects our interactions.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Data is all well and good, but let's not forget the human element. I'm curious about the ""vibe"" and the actual cost of keeping things running. Let's see what's really happening behind the scenes.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Data is a start, but let's not be naive. We need to know exactly what this inefficiency is costing us. I'm interested in the financial leaks and the physical state of the place.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is wise to seek truth in both numbers and spirit. To ensure a harmonious environment for all, I believe we should examine the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Servas, looking at the bins is a practical start. To get a clearer picture of the usage patterns I mentioned, I'll look into the fortnight's tally of use by person and the crumbs and bins at the desks.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I think it's important to understand where our communication currently stands. I will look into where the last awkward conversation happened and the unplanned talk since the refit.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, you're always so focused on the drama! I'm more interested in the hidden costs. I'll check the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the round trip for a hot lunch.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, focusing on lunch is a bit quaint, isn't it? I'll be looking at the quotes for the two fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire by the hour. Let's see where the money is actually going.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see such diverse perspectives. To complement your findings, I shall remain focused on the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks. Peace begins with a tidy space.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. By comparing the usage tally with the physical state of the room, we can determine if the current lack of rules is causing the disorder.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It seems we have a good balance of practical and social inquiries. I hope that by looking at our interactions, we can find a way to make the space truly supportive for everyone.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"Let's hope the numbers are as interesting as the gossip. I'm looking forward to seeing if our ""conveniences"" are actually just time-sinks in disguise. Who's ready for the reveal?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm ready. Though I suspect the ""reveal"" will simply confirm that we've been wasting resources. Let's see if any of you actually found something useful, or if this was just a wild goose chase.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Shunichi. Whether the results are surprising or expected, they will provide the clarity we need to move forward together in harmony. I look forward to hearing what you all have discovered.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let us proceed to the findings. I am interested to see if the data supports the need for a more structured system of responsibility for the room's upkeep.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we are all set. I look forward to seeing how the practical data and the social dynamics align to help us make the right decision for our shared space.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I'm all set too. Let's just hope we're not all staring at a bunch of boring spreadsheets. I'm expecting some juicy details about where our time is actually disappearing to!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Spreadsheets are only boring if you can't read them, May. I'm quite looking forward to seeing the actual figures. Let's get this over with and see who was actually paying attention.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the truth often reveals itself in the smallest details. Let us embrace whatever we find with an open heart and a spirit of cooperation. I am ready to listen.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
